{
  "title": "Third of Shaban",
  "data": "Birthday Dua of Imam Husayn (a.s.)\nFast on this day, and recite:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّيْۤ اَسْاَلُكَ بِحَقِّ الْمَوْلُوْدِ فِيْ هٰذَا الْيَوْمِ الْمَوْعُوْدِ بِشَهَادَتِهٖ قَبْلَ اسْتِهْلَالِهٖ وَوِلَادَتِهٖ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE AS'ALUKA BIHAQQIL MAWLOODI FEE HAADHAL YAWMIL MAW'OODI BISHAHAADATIHEE QABLAS TIHLAALIHEE WA WILAADATIH\nO Allah, I beseech You in the name of the one born on this day, the promised with martyrdom before the beginning of his lifetime and before his birth,\nبَكَتْهُ السَّمَاۤءُ وَمَنْ فِيْهَا وَالْاَرْضُ وَمَنْ عَلَيْهَا وَلَمَّا يَطَاْ لَابَتَيْهَا\nBAKAT-HUS SAMAA'U WA MAN FEEHAA WAL ARDU WA MAN A'LAYHAA WA LAMMAA YATA' LAABATAYHAA\nthe heavens and all their inhabitants wept for him; and so did the earth and those living on it before his feet stepped on it,\nقَتِيْلِ الْعَبْرَةِ وَسَيِّدِ الْاُسْرَةِ الْمَمْدُوْدِ بِالنُّصْرَةِ يَوْمَ الْكَرَّةِ\nQATEELIL A'BRATI WA SAYYIDIL USRATIL MAMDOODI BIN NUSRATI YAWMAL KARRAH\nthe mourned slain one, the master of the Family (of Prophethood), the one who shall be backed with victory on the Day of Return,\nالْمُعَوَّضِ مِنْ قَتْلِهٖ اَنَّ الْاَئِمَّةَ مِنْ نَسْلِهٖ وَالشِّفَاۤءَ فِيْ تُرْبَتِهٖ\nAL-MU'AWWADI MIN QATLIHEE ANNAL A'IMMATA MIN NASLIHEE WASH SHIFAA'A FEE TURBATIH\nthe one whom has been awarded the favor of the Imams' being from his offspring as recompense of his being slain, the one awarded the favor of the soil of his grave carrying cure,\nوَالْفَوْزَ مَعَهٗ فِيْۤ اَوْبَتِهٖ وَالْاَوْصِيَاۤءَ مِنْ عِتْرَتِهٖ بَعْدَ قَاۤئِمِهِمْ وَغَيْبَتِهٖ\nWAL FAWZA MA'AHOO FEE AWBATIHEE WAL AWSIYAA'A MIN I'TRATIHEE BA'DA QAA'IMIHIM WA GHAYBATIH\nthe one awarded the favor that he will be triumphing when he will be returned and the Prophet's Successors from his offspring will be returned after the advent of their Rising Imam and after his occultation\nحَتّٰى يُدْرِكُوْا الْاَوْتَارَ وَيَثْاَرُوْا الثَّارَ وَيَرْضُوْا الْجَبَّارَ وَيَكُوْنُوْا خَيْرَ اَنْصَارٍ\nHATTAA YUDRIKUL AWTAARA WA YATH'ARUTH THAARA WA YARDUL JABBAARA WA YAKOONOO KHAYRA ANSAAR\nso that they shall take revenge, retaliate, please the Omnipotent Lord, and be the best supporters.\nصَلَّى اللّٰهُ عَلَيْهِمْ مَعَ اخْتِلَافِ اللَّيْلِ وَالنَّهَارِ\nSALLALLAAHU A'LAYHIM MA'AKH TILAAFIL LAYLI WAN NAHAAR\nMay Allah's blessings be perpetually upon them whenever night and day succeed each other.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ فَبِحَقِّهِمْ اِلَيْكَ اَتَوَسَّلُ وَاَسْاَلُ سُؤَالَ مُقْتَرِفٍ مُعْتَرِفٍ مُسِيْۤءٍ اِلٰى نَفْسِهٖ مِمَّا فَرَّطَ فِيْ يَوْمِهٖ وَاَمْسِهٖ\nALLAAHUMMA FABIHAQQIHIM ILAYKA ATAWASSALU WA AS'ALU SU'AALA MUQTARIFIN MU'TARIFIN MUSEE'IN ILAA NAFSIHEE MIMMAA FARRATA FEE YAWMIHEE WA AMSIH\nO Allah, I thus beg You in the name of them and implore You with the imploration of a sinful one who confesses of his sin, and who has done evil to himself due to his violations— the past and the present.\nيَسْاَلُكَ الْعِصْمَةَ اِلٰى مَحَلِّ رَمْسِهٖ\nYAS'ALUKAL I'SMATA ILAA MAHALLI RAMSIH\nHe thus beseeches You for Your protection up to the place of his grave.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ فَصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَعِتْرَتِهٖ وَاحْشُرْنَا فِيْ زُمْرَتِهٖ وَبَوِّئْنَا مَعَهٗ دَارَ الْكَرَامَةِ وَمَحَلَّ الْاِقَامَةِ\nALLAAHUMMA FASALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA I'TRATIHEE WAHSHURNAA FEE ZUMRATIHEE WA BAWWI'NAA MA'AHOO DAARAL KARAAMATI WA MAHALLAL IQAAMAH\nO Allah, (please) send blessings to Muhammad and his Offspring, include us with his group (on the Resurrection Day), and allow us to dwell in the House of Honor with him and in the abode of residence.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَكَمَا اَكْرَمْتَنَا بِمَعْرِفَتِهٖ فَاَكْرِمْنَا بِزُلْفَتِهٖ وَارْزُقْنَا مُرَافَقَتَهٗ وَسَابِقَتَهٗ\nALLAAHUMMA WA KAMAA AKRAMTANAA BIMA'RIFATIHEE FA-AKRIMNAA BIZULFATIHEE WARZUQNAA MURAAFAQATAHOO WA SAABIQATAH\nO Allah, as You have conferred upon us with the honor of our recognition of him, so (please) confer upon us with the honor of being near to him, bestow upon us with the bliss of accompanying him _ and enjoying a close rank to him,\nوَاجْعَلْنَا مِمَّنْ يُسَلِّمُ لِاَمْرِهٖ وَيُكْثِرُ الصَّلَاةَ عَلَيْهِ عِنْدَ ذِكْرِهٖ\nWAJ'ALNAA MIMMAN YUSALLIMU LI-AMRIHEE WA YUKTHIRUS SALAATA A'LAYHI I'NDA DHIKRIH\nand include us with those who submit to him totally and those who invoke Your blessings upon him whenever they mention him,\nوَعَلٰى جَمِيْعِ اَوْصِيَاۤئِهٖ وَاَهْلِ اَصْفِيَاۤئِهِ الْمَمْدُوْدِيْنَ مِنْكَ بِالْعَدَدِ الْاِثْنٰي عَشَرَ النُّجُوْمِ الزُّهَرِ وَالْحُجَجِ عَلٰى جَمِيْعِ الْبَشَرِ\nWA A'LAA JAMEE'I AWSIYAA'IHEE WA AHLI ASFIYAA'IHIL MAMDOODEENA MINKA BIL A'DADIL ITHNAA A'SHARAN NUJOOMIZ ZUHARI WAL HUJAJI A'LAA JAMEE'IL BASHAR\nand upon all his Successors and Selected Ones, whom are defined by You as twelve persons, being the luminous stars, and the Arguments against all humankind.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَهَبْ لَنَا فِيْ هٰذَا الْيَوْمِ خَيْرَ مَوْهِبَةٍ وَاَنْجِحْ لَنَا فِيْهِ كُلَّ طَلِبَةٍ\nALLAAHUMMA WA HAB LANAA FEE HAADHAL YAWMI KHAYRA MAWHIBATIN WA ANJIH LANAA FEEHI KULLA TALIBAH\nO Allah, and (please) grant us on this day the best of grants, make all our prayers on this day responded,\nكَمَا وَهَبْتَ الْحُسَيْنَ لِمُحَمَّدٍ جَدِّهٖ وَعَاذَ فُطْرُسُ بِمَهْدِهٖ\nKAMAA WAHABTAL HUSAYNA LIMUHAMMADIN JADDIHEE WA A'ADHA FUTRUSU BIMAHDIH\njust as You gifted al-Husayn to Muhammad, his grandfather, just as the angel Futrus sought refuge with his (i.e. al-Husayn) cradle,\nفَنَحْنُ عَاۤئِذُوْنَ بِقَبْرِهٖ مِنْ بَعْدِهٖ نَشْهَدُ تُرْبَتَهٗ وَنَنْتَظِرُ اَوْبَتَهٗ\nFANAHNU A'A'IDHOONA BIQABRIHEE MIN BA'DIHEE NASH-HADU TURBATAHOO WA NANTAZIRU AWBATAH\nwe are thus seeking refuge with his tomb after him (i.e. his martyrdom), as we are witnessing the soil of him and expecting his return.\nاٰمِيْنَ رَبَّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ\nAAMEENA RABBAL A'ALAMEEN\nRespond to us, O Lord of the worlds.",
  "tabs": [
    "Last Dua of Imam Husayn (a.s.)\nAfter the birthday dua, recite the last dua of Imam al-Husayn (a.s.), which he said when his enemies surrounded him in large numbers on the day of Ashura:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اَنْتَ مُتَعَالِيْ الْمَكَانِ عَظِيْمُ الْجَبَرُوْتِ شَدِيْدُ الْمِحَالِ غَنِيٌّ عَنِ الْخَلَایِقِ عَرِيْضُ الْكِبْرِيَاۤءِ\nALLAAHUMMA ANTA MUTA'AALIL MAKAANI A'ZEEMUL JABAROOTI SHADEEDUL MIHAALI GHANIYYUN A'NIL KHALAAYIQI A'REEDUL KIBRIYAA'\nO Allah, You are verily the Elevated in position, the Magnificent in omnipotence, the Mighty in prowess, the Self-Sufficient from the creatures, the Ample in pride,\nقَادِرٌ عَلٰى مَا تَشَاۤءُ قَرِيْبُ الرَّحْمَةِ صَادِقُ الْوَعْدِ سَابِغُ النِّعْمَةِ حَسَنُ الْبَلَاۤءِ\nQAADIRUN A'LAA MAA TASHAA'U QAREEBUR RAHMATI SAADIQUL WA'DI SAABIGHUN NI'MATI HASANUL BALAA'\nthe Powerful over all that which You want, the Close in mercy, the Truthful in promise, the Opulent in favors, the Sympathetic in ordeals,\nقَرِيْبٌ اِذَا دُعِيْتَ مُحِيْطٌ بِمَا خَلَقْتَ قَابِلُ التَّوْبَةِ لِمَنْ تَابَ اِلَيْكَ قَادِرٌ عَلٰى مَاۤ اَرَدْتَ\nQAREEBUN IDHAA DU'EETA MUHEETUN BIMAA KHALAQTA QAABILUT TAWBATI LIMAN TAABA ILAYKA QAADIRUN A'LAA MAA ARADT\nthe Nigh when You are prayed, the All-encompassing of all that which You have created, the Accepter of the repentance of him who repents to You, the Powerful to do whatever You want,\nوَمُدْرِكٌ مَا طَلَبْتَ وَشَكُوْرٌ اِذَا شُكِرْتَ وَذَكُوْرٌ اِذَا ذُكِرْتَ\nWA MUDRIKUN MAA TALABTA WA SHAKOORUN IDHAA SHUKIRTA WA DHAKOORUN IDHAA DHUKIRT\nthe Taker in all that which You decide, the Thankful for those who thank You, and the Rememberer of those who mention You.\nاَدْعُوْكَ مُحْتَاجًا وَاَرْغَبُ اِلَيْكَ فَقِيْرًا وَاَفْزَعُ اِلَيْكَ خَاۤئِفًا\nAD'OOKA MUHTAAJAN WA ARGHABU ILAYKA FAQEERAN WA AFZA'U ILAYKA KHAA'IFAA\nI pray You for I need You, I desire for You for I am in want of You, I resort to You for I am terrified,\nوَاَبْكِيْۤ اِلَيْكَ مَكْرُوْبًا وَاَسْتَعِيْنُ بِكَ ضَعِيْفًا وَاَتَوَكَّلُ عَلَيْكَ كَافِيًا\nWA ABKEE ILAYKA MAKROOBAN WA ASTA'EENU BIKA DA'EEFAN WA ATAWAKKALU A'LAYKA KAAFIYAA\nI weep before You for I am distressed, I seek Your aid for I am weak, and I depend upon You for I trust in none save You.\nاُحْكُمْ بَيْنَنَا وَبَيْنَ قَوْمِنَا [بِالْحَقِّ] فَاِنَّهُمْ غَرُّوْنَا وَخَدَعُوْنَا وَخَذَلُوْنَا وَغَدَرُوْا بِنَا وَقَتَلُوْنَا\nUHKUM BAYNANAA WA BAYNA QAWMINAA BIL HAQQI FA-INNAHUM GHARROONAA WA KHADA'OONAA WA KHADHALOONAA WA GHADAROO BINAA WA QATALOONAA\n(Please do) decide between our people and us with the truth, for they have deceived us, cheated us, disappointed us, betrayed us, and killed us.\nوَنَحْنُ عِتْرَةُ نَبِيِّكَ وَوَلَدُ حَبِيْبِكَ مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ عَبْدِ اللّٰهِ الَّذِيْ اصْطَفَيْتَهٗ بِالرِّسَالَةِ وَائْتَمَنْتَهٗ عَلٰى وَحْيِكَ\nWA NAHNU I'TRATU NABIYYIKA WA WALADU HABEEBIKA MUHAMMADIBNI A'BDILLAAHIL LADHIS TAFAYTAHOO BIR RISAALATI WA'TAMANTAHOO A'LAA WAHYIK\nWe are the progeny of Your Prophet and the sons of Your beloved one; namely, Muhammad the son of 'Abdullah, whom You have chosen for the Divine Mission and for keeping Your Revelation.\nفَاجْعَلْ لَنَا مِنْ اَمْرِنَا فَرَجًا وَمَخْرَجًا بِرَحْمَتِكَ يَاۤ اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ\nFAJ'AL LANAA MIN AMRINAA FARAJAN WA MAKHRAJAN BIRAHMATIKA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN\nSo, (please) prepare a way out and a relief for us, out of Your mercy, O most Merciful of all those who show mercy!"
  ],
  "merits": "About this blessed day, Shaykh al-Tusi says in Misbah al-Mutahajjid: Imam al-Husayn ibn Ali (a.s.) was born on the third of Sha'ban. Abu'l-Qasim ibn 'Ala' al-Hamadani, the representative of Imam al-Hasan al-'Askari (a.s.), received a document telling that our master, Imam al-Husayn ibn Ali (a.s.), was born on the third of Sha'ban; therefore, you should observe fasting on this day and say this supplicatory prayer.\n\nLast Dua of Imam Husayn (a.s.): Ibn 'Ayyash has reported al-Husayn ibn Ali ibn Sufyan al-Bazufi as saying that he heard Imam Ja'far al-Sadiq (a.s.) saying this supplicatory prayer on the third of Sha'ban, the birthday of Imam al-Husayn (a.s.)."
}
